"""Embed the WCAG tool-use skill into Qwen3.5-0.8B via closed-form weight editing.

Variant of embed_wcag_skill.py for the AI-WCAG-Gauntlet loop: instead of a
single boolean (violation yes/no), the skill is two questions over gauntlet
state text:
  - next_tool (choice over w3c/axe/pa11y/qualweb/fix/check): which validator
    or action comes next in the Audit->Triage->Fix->Verify->Prevent workflow
  - run_precheck (boolean): run a validator on your own code before the
    official iteration check?

Teacher = vegaml policy fitted on tooluse_fit.jsonl (real gauntlet validator
flags). Student edit = MEMIT-style rank-256 column edit on one MLP down_proj,
targeting the logit gap between the gold option token and the best non-gold
option token (choice) or yes-vs-no (boolean), summed across both questions.

Requires: vegaml, transformers, torch (Kaggle T4 or P100)
"""
from __future__ import annotations

import json, math, os, random, time
from typing import Dict, List

import torch

